    "# Lab 2: Data Management and Row Selection\n",
    "\n",
    "## Learning Outcomes\n",
    "\n",
    "By the end of this lab you will be able to:\n",
    "\n",
    "- Create analytical subsets of data\n",
    "- Apply row filtering using logical conditions\n",
    "- Investigate missing data\n",
    "- Replace invalid codes with NaN values\n",
    "- Understand skip patterns in survey datasets\n",
    "- Recode missing values into meaningful categories\n",
    "- Use pandas to support data management decisions\n",
    "\n",
    "This lab builds directly on Lab 1 and continues using the NESARC dataset."
   ]
