    "# Part 2: Row Selection and Data Subsetting\n",
    "\n",
    "In Lab 1 frequency distributions were calculated on the entire dataset.\n",
    "\n",
    "We will now focus on a subset:\n",
    "\n",
    "- Age between 18 and 25 inclusive\n",
    "- Smoked within the last 12 months (CHECK321 = 1)\n",
    "\n",
    "This produces a dataset tailored to the research question."
   ]
