      "source": [
        "# Part 1: Why Data Management Matters\n",
        "\n",
        "Before conducting analysis or building predictive models, analysts must understand the quality and meaning of their data.\n",
        "\n",
        "Data management involves making justified decisions about:\n",
        "\n",
        "- Which observations should be included\n",
        "- Which observations should be excluded\n",
        "- How missing values should be handled\n",
        "- How coded survey responses should be interpreted\n",
        "\n",
        "Poor data management often leads to misleading analysis results."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
